Built with Meta Llama 3.
The adapter's training targets were produced by LLM2Vec-Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct-mntp-supervised
(McGill-NLP, MIT), which runs Meta Llama 3 weights. Meta Llama 3 is licensed under the
Meta Llama 3 Community License, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. All Rights Reserved.
A copy of the agreement is in LICENSE-LLAMA3.txt and of the Acceptable Use Policy in
USE_POLICY-LLAMA3.md. The adapter contains no Llama 3 weights. If the Meta Llama 3
Community License applies to the adapter, it applies in addition to the Apache License.

Training data includes Motion Data by Bones Studio.
EDDY was not trained on Bones motion data. BONES-SEED motions (Bones SEED license) were used
only to run the benchmark evaluation reported in the documentation.

Training texts:
- SEED-Timeline-Annotations, NVIDIA, CC BY 4.0
  (https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/SEED-Timeline-Annotations).
  EDDY uses the labels as published and, in its joined training texts, concatenates
  2 or 3 consecutive labels into one text.
- HumanML3D captions, Guo et al., MIT (https://github.com/EricGuo5513/HumanML3D).

Evaluation:
- Kimodo Motion Generation Benchmark, NVIDIA, CC BY 4.0
  (https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Kimodo-Motion-Gen-Benchmark).
- ARDY-SOMA-RP-30FPS-Horizon60, NVIDIA Open Model Agreement; TMR-SOMA-RP-v1, NVIDIA Open
  Model License. Neither is included in this distribution.

Input model: Qwen3-Embedding-8B, Qwen team, Apache-2.0. Not included in this distribution.

